 "text": "Midland County GeoHub\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nShare\nShare\nAdd to Favorites\nShare\nShare\nClose\nSign In\nExplore\nData\nDocuments\nApps & Maps\nRecent Downloads\nNew\nSign In\nAs part of Midland County’s commitment to our community, improving citizen engagement, and enhancing transparency and accountability to its residents, the Midland County GIS Department is pleased to provide public access to its core GIS data for free as part of our Open Data Initiative.\nMidland County realizes that the greatest value of data comes from having it freely shared among agencies, governments, the public, and the private sector. By providing this data we feel that we are investing in the future of the Midland County community.\nOn this site, Midland County will share many of our core GIS datasets, as well as web applications that may be useful to visitors and residents\nMidland County GIS Datasets\nClick one of the categories below to access the dataset's item details page. You can view, filter, and download data from the item details page.\nThese datasets are distributed and transmitted ‘as is’ without warranties of any kind, either expressed or implied, including without limitations, warranties of title or implied warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose. Midland County does not guarantee the accuracy, timeliness, or completeness of the data provided on this website.Parcel data provided is neither a legally recorded map nor a survey and is not intended to be used as such.\nData Hub Updates\nUpdates, changes, or additions will be posted here. Parcels, roads, and address point datasets are typically updated every 6-8 weeks.\n3/24/2026 Updated Road Centerlines Layer\n1/20/2026 Updated Parcel Boundaries Layer\n1/20/2026 Updated Address Point Layer\n10/19/21 - Updated Building Footprints Layer\n10/14/21 - Posted 2020 County Imagery Mosaic SID file\n10/1/21 - Added Tax Status Description field in Land Information.\n08/02/21 - Major update to hydro dataset using 2020/2021 imagery.\nMidland County 6\" Aerial Imagery Downloads\n2020 Imagery Zip File - County Mosaic*\n*Twp Mosaics available upon request from GIS Dept\n2015 Imagery Zip File - County Mosaic\n2010 Imagery Zip File - Township Mosaics\n2005 Imagery Zip File - Township Mosaics\nOther Midland County Downloads\nDEM and Hillshade\nData Services Hosted in AGO\nParcel Boundaries\nRoad Centerlines\nAddress Points/Building Footprints\nHydrography\n1 foot Contours\nAerial Imagery Tile Services\nMidland County Web Applications\nMidland County FetchGIS\nThe Midland County FetchGIS Viewer provides parcel and tax information as well as other GIS layers and tools in an easy to use web map.\nCopyright 2020 Midland County GIS Department | 220 W. Ellsworth St. | Midland, MI 48640 | (989) 837-7147\nFor issues or data questions: gis@co.midland.mi.us\nBuilt with\nArcGIS Hub\nExplore Feeds\nShare",
